{"seq":1,"slug":"design-thinking-fundamentals","title":"设计思维基础","stage":"DONE","category":"design-thinking","chapterCount":3,"docCount":11,"url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 设计思维基础 简介\n\n设计思维是一种以人为中心的创新方法论，它将设计师解决问题的方式系统化为可学习、可复制的思维框架。从斯坦福大学 d.school 的推广到全球企业的广泛采用，设计思维已经超越了设计领域本身，成为产品创新、服务改进和组织变革的重要工具。\n\n本知识库面向希望掌握设计思维方法论的学习者，无论你是产品经理、工程师、创业者还是任何需要创造性解决问题的从业者，都能在这里建立系统的设计思维认知框架。\n\n全书共分为三章，从设计思维的理论基础出发，深入到用户研究的实践方法，再到问题定义与重构的核心技能。\n\n第一章**起源与核心原则**梳理设计思维的发展历史和理论脉络，讲解以人为中心、快速迭代、拥抱不确定性等核心原则，并通过与传统方法的对比帮助你理解设计思维的独特价值和思维模式转变。\n\n第二章**共情与用户研究**聚焦设计思维的第一步也是最关键的一步——深入理解用户，介绍共情方法、用户访谈技巧、观察技术以及用户画像构建等实用工具，帮助你建立真正以用户为中心的研究能力。\n\n第三章**定义与重构**讲解如何将用户研究中获得的信息转化为清晰的问题定义，涵盖问题框架的构建方法、HMW 问题法的运用以及洞察综合的技巧，帮助你学会在正确的问题上集中创新力量。\n\n推荐学习路径为先通过第一章建立设计思维的整体认知和思维模式基础，再通过第二章掌握用户研究的实践技能，最后通过第三章学会将研究成果转化为可操作的问题定义。建议在学习过程中选择一个实际项目进行练习，将方法论应用于真实场景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"origins-and-principles","title":"起源与核心原则","docCount":4,"url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/origins-and-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"history-of-design-thinking","title":"设计思维的历史演变","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/origins-and-principles/history-of-design-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-principles","title":"设计思维的核心原则","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/origins-and-principles/core-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mindset-shift","title":"从工程思维到设计思维的转变","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/origins-and-principles/mindset-shift"},{"seq":4,"slug":"dt-vs-traditional","title":"设计思维与传统方法论的对比","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/origins-and-principles/dt-vs-traditional"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"empathy-and-user-research","title":"共情与用户研究","docCount":4,"url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/empathy-and-user-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"empathy-methods","title":"共情方法与深度理解","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/empathy-and-user-research/empathy-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-interview","title":"用户访谈的方法与技巧","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/empathy-and-user-research/user-interview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"observation-techniques","title":"观察技术与田野调查","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/empathy-and-user-research/observation-techniques"},{"seq":4,"slug":"persona-building","title":"用户画像的构建与应用","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/empathy-and-user-research/persona-building"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"define-and-reframe","title":"定义与重构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/define-and-reframe","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-framing","title":"问题框架与重新定义","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/define-and-reframe/problem-framing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hmw-questions","title":"HMW 问题设计方法","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/define-and-reframe/hmw-questions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"insight-synthesis","title":"洞察综合与意义建构","url":"/h/design-thinking/design-thinking-fundamentals/define-and-reframe/insight-synthesis"}]}]}